{"title":"LoadBalancerClient 自定义","uid":"ce082ba9e3fbc68b03ea7b9c59d31588","slug":"feign/LoadBalancerClient 自定义","date":"2025-02-09T18:52:22.000Z","updated":"2025-03-30T03:52:57.826Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/feign/LoadBalancerClient 自定义.json","keywords":null,"cover":null,"content":"<h2 id=\"自定义路由信息\"><a href=\"#自定义路由信息\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"自定义路由信息\"></a>自定义路由信息</h2><blockquote><span class=\"custom-blockquote-svg\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-reactroot=\"\">\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M22 12C22 6.5 17.5 2 12 2C6.5 2 2 6.5 2 12C2 17.5 6.5 22 12 22C13.8 22 15.5 21.5 17 20.6L22 22L20.7 17C21.5 15.5 22 13.8 22 12Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M15.97 11.5H16.04C17.12 11.5 18 12.38 18 13.47V13.53C18 14.62 17.12 15.5 16.03 15.5H15.96C14.88 15.5 14 14.62 14 13.53V13.46C14 12.38 14.88 11.5 15.97 11.5Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M7.97 11.5H8.04C9.12 11.5 10 12.38 10 13.47V13.53C10 14.62 9.12 15.5 8.03 15.5H7.97C6.88 15.5 6 14.62 6 13.53V13.46C6 12.38 6.88 11.5 7.97 11.5Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M17 8.5C15.23 8.97 14.07 10.84 14.01 13.27C14 13.33 14 13.4 14 13.47V13.5\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M9 8.5C7.23 8.97 6.07 10.84 6.01 13.27C6 13.33 6 13.4 6 13.47V13.5\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M15.97 11.5H16.04C17.12 11.5 18 12.38 18 13.47V13.53C18 14.62 17.12 15.5 16.03 15.5H15.96C14.88 15.5 14 14.62 14 13.53V13.46C14 12.38 14.88 11.5 15.97 11.5Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M7.97 11.5H8.04C9.12 11.5 10 12.38 10 13.47V13.53C10 14.62 9.12 15.5 8.03 15.5H7.97C6.88 15.5 6 14.62 6 13.53V13.46C6 12.38 6.88 11.5 7.97 11.5Z\"></path>\n</svg>\n</span><p>日常开发中 loadBalancer 一般是基于服务发现，不需要我们显示的指定；某些场景下（比如单元测试、联调）需要我们自定义 LoadBalancerClient，不走默认的服务发现，而是自定义路由信息</p></blockquote>\n<ul>\n<li><code>LoadBalancerClient</code> 默认的配置是 <code>LoadBalancerClientConfiguration</code></li>\n<li>仿造 <code>LoadBalancerClientConfiguration</code> 实现自己的配置</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote><span class=\"custom-blockquote-svg\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-reactroot=\"\">\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M22 12C22 6.5 17.5 2 12 2C6.5 2 2 6.5 2 12C2 17.5 6.5 22 12 22C13.8 22 15.5 21.5 17 20.6L22 22L20.7 17C21.5 15.5 22 13.8 22 12Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M15.97 11.5H16.04C17.12 11.5 18 12.38 18 13.47V13.53C18 14.62 17.12 15.5 16.03 15.5H15.96C14.88 15.5 14 14.62 14 13.53V13.46C14 12.38 14.88 11.5 15.97 11.5Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M7.97 11.5H8.04C9.12 11.5 10 12.38 10 13.47V13.53C10 14.62 9.12 15.5 8.03 15.5H7.97C6.88 15.5 6 14.62 6 13.53V13.46C6 12.38 6.88 11.5 7.97 11.5Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M17 8.5C15.23 8.97 14.07 10.84 14.01 13.27C14 13.33 14 13.4 14 13.47V13.5\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M9 8.5C7.23 8.97 6.07 10.84 6.01 13.27C6 13.33 6 13.4 6 13.47V13.5\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M15.97 11.5H16.04C17.12 11.5 18 12.38 18 13.47V13.53C18 14.62 17.12 15.5 16.03 15.5H15.96C14.88 15.5 14 14.62 14 13.53V13.46C14 12.38 14.88 11.5 15.97 11.5Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M7.97 11.5H8.04C9.12 11.5 10 12.38 10 13.47V13.53C10 14.62 9.12 15.5 8.03 15.5H7.97C6.88 15.5 6 14.62 6 13.53V13.46C6 12.38 6.88 11.5 7.97 11.5Z\"></path>\n</svg>\n</span><p>由于<code>LoadBalancerClientConfiguration</code>也是基于 NamedContextFactory，所以我们只需要实现需要修改的配置，其他配置会默认读取<code>LoadBalancerClientConfiguration</code></p>\n<p>比如下面的代码中，自定义了服务路由信息，会根据配置返回服务的路由信息</p></blockquote>\n<figure class=\"shiki Java\"><div class='codeblock'><div class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br><span class=\"line\">19</span><br><span class=\"line\">20</span><br><span class=\"line\">21</span><br><span class=\"line\">22</span><br><span class=\"line\">23</span><br><span class=\"line\">24</span><br><span class=\"line\">25</span><br><span class=\"line\">26</span><br><span class=\"line\">27</span><br><span class=\"line\">28</span><br><span class=\"line\">29</span><br><span class=\"line\">30</span><br><span class=\"line\">31</span><br><span class=\"line\">32</span><br><span class=\"line\">33</span><br><span class=\"line\">34</span><br><span class=\"line\">35</span><br><span class=\"line\">36</span><br><span class=\"line\">37</span><br><span class=\"line\">38</span><br><span class=\"line\">39</span><br><span class=\"line\">40</span><br><span class=\"line\">41</span><br><span class=\"line\">42</span><br><span class=\"line\">43</span><br><span class=\"line\">44</span><br><span class=\"line\">45</span><br><span class=\"line\">46</span><br></pre></div><div class=\"code\"><pre><code>public class UserServiceLoadBalanceConfiguration {\n\n    @Bean\n    public ReactorLoadBalancer<ServiceInstance> reactorServiceInstanceLoadBalancer(Environment environment,\n                                                                                   LoadBalancerClientFactory loadBalancerClientFactory) {\n        // 获取当前 loadBalance 的 client name\n        // 由于此配置用在 UserRegistrationService 上，所以这里默认 = user-service\n        String name = environment.getProperty(LoadBalancerClientFactory.PROPERTY_NAME);\n        return new RoundRobinLoadBalancer(\n                // 这里相当于根据这个name，找到对应的子context，从里面获取到 ServiceInstanceListSupplier 对应的bean\n                // 也就是相当于这个 UserRegistrationServiceLoadBalanceConfiguration 下配置的 ServiceInstanceListSupplier -> 也就是 ServiceInstanceListSupplier\n                loadBalancerClientFactory.getLazyProvider(name, ServiceInstanceListSupplier.class),\n                name\n        );\n    }\n\n    @Bean\n    public ServiceInstanceListSupplier userServiceClientServiceInstanceListSupplier(\n            ConfigurableApplicationContext context) {\n        return new UserServiceServiceInstanceListSupplier(context.getEnvironment());\n    }\n\n}\n\npublic class UserServiceServiceInstanceListSupplier implements ServiceInstanceListSupplier {\n\n    private final Environment environment;\n\n    public UserServiceServiceInstanceListSupplier(Environment environment) {\n        this.environment = environment;\n    }\n\n    @Override\n    public String getServiceId() {\n        return environment.getProperty(\"user-service-name\", \"user-service\");\n    }\n\n    @Override\n    public Flux<List<ServiceInstance>> get() {\n        DefaultServiceInstance defaultServiceInstance = new DefaultServiceInstance();\n        defaultServiceInstance.setServiceId(getServiceId());\n        defaultServiceInstance.setHost(environment.getProperty(\"user-service-host\", \"127.0.0.1\"));\n        defaultServiceInstance.setPort(Integer.parseInt(environment.getProperty(\"user-service-port\", \"8080\")));\n        return Flux.just(Arrays.asList(defaultServiceInstance));\n    }\n}</code></pre></div></div></figure>\n\n<ul>\n<li>使用，注解上指定配置即可</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote><span class=\"custom-blockquote-svg\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-reactroot=\"\">\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M22 12C22 6.5 17.5 2 12 2C6.5 2 2 6.5 2 12C2 17.5 6.5 22 12 22C13.8 22 15.5 21.5 17 20.6L22 22L20.7 17C21.5 15.5 22 13.8 22 12Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M15.97 11.5H16.04C17.12 11.5 18 12.38 18 13.47V13.53C18 14.62 17.12 15.5 16.03 15.5H15.96C14.88 15.5 14 14.62 14 13.53V13.46C14 12.38 14.88 11.5 15.97 11.5Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path fill=\"\" d=\"M7.97 11.5H8.04C9.12 11.5 10 12.38 10 13.47V13.53C10 14.62 9.12 15.5 8.03 15.5H7.97C6.88 15.5 6 14.62 6 13.53V13.46C6 12.38 6.88 11.5 7.97 11.5Z\" undefined=\"1\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M17 8.5C15.23 8.97 14.07 10.84 14.01 13.27C14 13.33 14 13.4 14 13.47V13.5\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M9 8.5C7.23 8.97 6.07 10.84 6.01 13.27C6 13.33 6 13.4 6 13.47V13.5\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M15.97 11.5H16.04C17.12 11.5 18 12.38 18 13.47V13.53C18 14.62 17.12 15.5 16.03 15.5H15.96C14.88 15.5 14 14.62 14 13.53V13.46C14 12.38 14.88 11.5 15.97 11.5Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"\" d=\"M7.97 11.5H8.04C9.12 11.5 10 12.38 10 13.47V13.53C10 14.62 9.12 15.5 8.03 15.5H7.97C6.88 15.5 6 14.62 6 13.53V13.46C6 12.38 6.88 11.5 7.97 11.5Z\"></path>\n</svg>\n</span><p>@LoadBalancerClient(name &#x3D; “user-service”, configuration &#x3D; UserServiceLoadBalanceConfiguration.class)</p></blockquote>\n<ul>\n<li>以上就能实现自定义路由的功能</li>\n</ul>\n","text":"自定义路由信息 日常开发中 loadBalancer 一般是基于服务发现，不需要我们显示的指定；某些场景下（比如单元测试、联调）需要我们自定义 LoadBala...","permalink":"/post/feign/LoadBalancerClient 自定义","photos":[],"count_time":{"symbolsCount":"2.6k","symbolsTime":"2 mins."},"categories":[{"name":"feign","slug":"feign","count":3,"path":"api/categories/feign.json"}],"tags":[{"name":"feign","slug":"feign","count":3,"path":"api/tags/feign.json"},{"name":"rpc","slug":"rpc","count":3,"path":"api/tags/rpc.json"},{"name":"微服务","slug":"微服务","count":3,"path":"api/tags/微服务.json"}],"toc":"<ol class=\"toc\"><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-2\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#%E8%87%AA%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E8%B7%AF%E7%94%B1%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF\"><span class=\"toc-text\">自定义路由信息</span></a></li></ol>","author":{"name":"WU LEI","slug":"blog-author","avatar":"/images/avatar.jpg","link":"/","description":"Code & Life <br> 道阻且长，行则将至","socials":{"github":"https://github.com/taeyang0126","twitter":"","stackoverflow":"","wechat":"","qq":"","weibo":"","zhihu":"","csdn":"","juejin":"","customs":{}}},"mapped":true,"hidden":false,"prev_post":{"title":"raft","uid":"8ebf7895d2116fe0071fa42961dae531","slug":"分布式/算法/raft","date":"2025-02-09T19:50:22.000Z","updated":"2025-03-30T03:52:57.829Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/分布式/算法/raft.json","keywords":null,"cover":null,"text":"Raft 的核心目标和基本工作原理核心目标： 在分布式系统中达成共识，实现强一致性。 在保证一致性的基础上进行可靠的数据复制。 基本工作原理： 领导者选举：使用...","permalink":"/post/分布式/算法/raft","photos":[],"count_time":{"symbolsCount":"2.9k","symbolsTime":"3 mins."},"categories":[{"name":"分布式","slug":"分布式","count":1,"path":"api/categories/分布式.json"}],"tags":[{"name":"分布式","slug":"分布式","count":5,"path":"api/tags/分布式.json"},{"name":"算法","slug":"算法","count":1,"path":"api/tags/算法.json"},{"name":"raft","slug":"raft","count":1,"path":"api/tags/raft.json"}],"author":{"name":"WU LEI","slug":"blog-author","avatar":"/images/avatar.jpg","link":"/","description":"Code & Life <br> 道阻且长，行则将至","socials":{"gith